Z||000004||Philphine||02-12-2001||12:34 AM||||i got 3 with 2 decent tires at a flea market for $75. since they're not my main tires (use them like 16" spares) i can be patcient looking for the 4th one. ||||reg||1
Z||000005||rogergarrison||02-12-2001||04:48 PM||||check with chevy dealers around you or big tire/wheel specialty shops. They may have trade ins for someone who got custom wheels.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Cooter||02-12-2001||05:27 PM||||I got my 16 inch Sunfire rims by asking a guy who had just put custom wheels on his car. He had no need for the old wheels and gave them to me for $150. Look around and see if someone has riced up their cavalier and just ask them for their old wheels.||||reg||1
